# said-vs-done — what never goes into the published package.
#
# `files` in package.json is the allow-list and is the real control; this file
# is the belt to its braces. A published tarball is not revocable, so the two
# mechanisms are deliberately redundant.
.env
.env.*
test/
.github/
.said-vs-done/
.said-vs-done.json
*.tgz
